--- !u!114 &1100048461
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1100048459}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 6ee71bae2b2ea2d4386dce41c6feac80, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Dialoguebox
  DialogueSegments:
  - Dialogue: Excuse me, do you know the best way to the tower?
    Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: eaff7ea8a8cfb0e45b2ee58dbe2e539a, type: 2}
    Choices: []
  - Dialogue: The tower? No, NO! I'll tell you a thing or two about forsaken that
      tower!!
    Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f02acdfa244796d4dbc6dfb3f982dcd7, type: 2}
    Choices: []
  - Dialogue: Dad, please, drink your remedy tea.. Excuse my old man, he's seen better
      days. Ugh, if you want to reach the tower, you're out of luck. A sinkhole opened
      up a while ago after this huge explosion. And there's no builders left with
      enough will or energy to make a bridge.
    Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4d0263bb8faeac44abdcd7c22016e348, type: 2}
    Choices: []
  - Dialogue: "My father used to be a builder, but he won\u2019t be able to help.
      And even if there wasn't a sinkhole it would be kind of hard for him to make
      the trek to the tower. He's old, and the time spent working at that tower changed
      him."
    Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4d0263bb8faeac44abdcd7c22016e348, type: 2}
    Choices:
    - ChoiceText: Did you stay behind for your father?
      NextSegmentIndex: 4
      Condition:
        Type: 0
        RequiredItem: {fileID: 0}
        RequiredQuest: {fileID: 0}
      onChoiceSelected:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    - ChoiceText: Are there really no builders left?
      NextSegmentIndex: 7
      Condition:
        Type: 0
        RequiredItem: {fileID: 0}
        RequiredQuest: {fileID: 0}
      onChoiceSelected:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    - ChoiceText: Goodbye.
      NextSegmentIndex: -1
      Condition:
        Type: 0
        RequiredItem: {fileID: 0}
        RequiredQuest: {fileID: 0}
      onChoiceSelected:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
  - Dialogue: 'Yeah, he''s not really capable of caring for himself at this point.
      Once he passes, I''ll see if I can make it to the tower somehow. '
    Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4d0263bb8faeac44abdcd7c22016e348, type: 2}
    Choices: []
  - Dialogue: "I ain\u2019t passing any time soon, sonny! And you know I can take
      care of myself just fine!!"
    Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f02acdfa244796d4dbc6dfb3f982dcd7, type: 2}
    Choices: []
  - Dialogue: "We\u2019ve talked about this, father.."
    Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4d0263bb8faeac44abdcd7c22016e348, type: 2}
    Choices:
    - ChoiceText: Are there really no builders left?
      NextSegmentIndex: 7
      Condition:
        Type: 0
        RequiredItem: {fileID: 0}
        RequiredQuest: {fileID: 0}
      onChoiceSelected:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    - ChoiceText: Goodbye.
      NextSegmentIndex: -1
      Condition:
        Type: 0
        RequiredItem: {fileID: 0}
        RequiredQuest: {fileID: 0}
      onChoiceSelected:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
  - Dialogue: Well, there is the one who lives outside the town, close to the sinkhole.
      But he's a bit of a loner. He doesn't talk to us at all. He's weird.
    Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4d0263bb8faeac44abdcd7c22016e348, type: 2}
    Choices: []
  - Dialogue: But he could still build a bridge over the sinkhole?
    Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: eaff7ea8a8cfb0e45b2ee58dbe2e539a, type: 2}
    Choices: []
  - Dialogue: 'If you want to try and convince him, be my guest. I don''t think he''ll
      take kindly to outsiders knocking on his door. '
    Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4d0263bb8faeac44abdcd7c22016e348, type: 2}
    Choices:
    - ChoiceText: Did you stay behind for your father?
      NextSegmentIndex: 4
      Condition:
        Type: 0
        RequiredItem: {fileID: 0}
        RequiredQuest: {fileID: 0}
      onChoiceSelected:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    - ChoiceText: Goodbye.
      NextSegmentIndex: -1
      Condition:
        Type: 0
        RequiredItem: {fileID: 0}
        RequiredQuest: {fileID: 0}
      onChoiceSelected:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
